{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-methods-foundations","title":"数值方法基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations","docs":[{"seq":0,"slug":"2-nonlinear-root-finding","title":"非线性方程求根","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations/2-nonlinear-root-finding","wordCount":2230,"readingTime":9},{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-system-solvers","title":"线性方程组求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations/linear-system-solvers","wordCount":2460,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"numerical-integration-differentiation","title":"数值积分与微分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/numerical-methods-foundations/numerical-integration-differentiation","wordCount":2258,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数值方法基础\">数值方法基础</h1><p>本章是整个 hub 的基石。线性方程组求解讨论直接法与迭代法的选择策略、条件数与误差传播；非线性方程求根覆盖从二分法到牛顿法的收敛阶分析；数值积分与微分建立求积公式精度与函数光滑性的联系。</p>\n<p>线性方程组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ax = b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是科学计算的&quot;通用语言&quot;——几乎所有数值方法最终都归结为求解一个或多个线性方程组。偏微分方程离散化产生稀疏矩阵，最小二乘拟合产生正规方程，隐式时间积分产生雅可比迭代矩阵。理解直接法（LU、Cholesky、QR）与迭代法（CG、GMRES、BiCGSTAB）的适用边界，是工程师做出正确技术选型的第一步。</p>\n<p>非线性方程求根 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是工程设计中的核心问题。确定机翼的临界攻角、求解化学反应的平衡浓度、计算结构的屈曲载荷——这些都可以表述为求根问题。二分法提供了绝对可靠的兜底方案，牛顿法以二次收敛为代价要求雅可比矩阵，拟牛顿法（BFGS、Broyden）在导数不可得时用割线近似维持超线性收敛。</p>\n<p>数值积分与微分处理连续量的离散近似。从梯形公式到 Simpson 公式再到高斯求积，精度的提升来自对被积函数光滑性的更充分利用。数值微分则面临&quot;步长太小则舍入误差主导，步长太大则截断误差主导&quot;的固有困境，复步微分法和自动微分为这一两难提供了现代解法。</p>\n<p>三篇文档共享一条方法论主线：理解算法的数学性质（收敛性、稳定性、精度）远比记忆公式重要。读者应能根据问题特征（矩阵稀疏性、函数非线性程度、光滑性）选择合适方法，并估算计算成本。</p>\n<p>学习本章后，读者将能够：判断一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 阶稀疏线性系统该用直接法还是迭代法；为一个多变量非线性方程组选择合适的求根策略并预估迭代次数；根据被积函数的光滑性选择求积公式并估计积分误差。这些能力是后续章节中 ODE 和 PDE 求解器的基础。</p>\n"}